---
const relay = [
  { glyph: "◆", label: "agent", kind: "" },
  { glyph: "⊟", label: "service<br/>signs", kind: "svc" },
  { glyph: "▤", label: "public<br/>log", kind: "" },
  { glyph: "⬢", label: "you<br/>verify", kind: "you" },
];
---

<section class="sec" id="network">
  <div class="wrap inv-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The key inversion</span>
      <p class="quote">
        The finder reports the sighting. <span class="hl"
          >Never the thing being found.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p class="inv-body">
        A lost AirTag can't lie about where it is, because it isn't the one
        talking. The phones around it are. Sello moves the pen the same way: the
        service that handled the action signs the sighting, so a compromised
        agent can't quietly rewrite its own trail.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="relay reveal">
      <span class="lbl">One sighting, relayed</span>
      <div class="relay-row">
        {
          relay.map((node, i) => (
            <>
              {i > 0 && <span class="relay-arr">→</span>}
              <div class={`relay-node${node.kind ? ` ${node.kind}` : ""}`}>
                <div class="rn-ic">{node.glyph}</div>
                <div class="rn-t" set:html={node.label} />
              </div>
            </>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class="relay-cap">
        The agent passes through. The <b>service</b> seals what it saw and drops it
        in a public log. You pull it back later and verify. The agent never holds
        the pen.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .inv-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 3vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .quote .hl {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .inv-body {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .relay {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    padding: 28px 26px;
  }

  .relay .lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: block;
  }

  .relay-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .relay-node {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .relay-node .rn-ic {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    margin: 0 auto 9px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .relay-node.svc .rn-ic {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .relay-node.you .rn-ic {
    border-color: var(--blue-dim);
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .relay-node .rn-t {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .relay-arr {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .relay-cap {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .relay-cap b {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .inv-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }
</style>
